          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "1992年6月，$<21$ 世纪议程》，破坏环境—→可持续发展",
          "block_bbox": [
            343,
            445,
            1554,
            503
          ],
          "block_id": 1,
          "block_order": 1
        },
        {
          "block_label": "paragraph_title",
          "block_content": "4.城市化问题",
          "block_bbox": [
            245,
            639,
            590,
            694
          ],
          "block_id": 2,
          "block_order": 2
        },
        {
          "block_label": "paragraph_title",
          "block_content": "(1)人口和城市的分布",
          "block_bbox": [
            314,
            734,
            813,
            793
          ],
          "block_id": 3,
          "block_order": 3
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "①特点：人口分布极不平衡，90%的人口居住在东部沿海地带，而且大城市十分集中。\n",
          "block_bbox": [
            234,
            827,
            2007,
            979
          ],
          "block_id": 4,
          "block_order": 4
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "②带来许多“城市病”：资源紧缺、交通拥挤、住房困难，就业紧张、污染严重、犯罪增多.\n",
          "block_bbox": [
            225,
            1016,
            2014,
            1164
          ],
          "block_id": 5,
          "block_order": 5
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "3解决措施：进行合理的城市规划、建立卫星城：城市中工业和人口向郊区分散;加强城市管理、重视保护和治理城市环境。\n",
          "block_bbox": [
            216,
            1208,
            2028,
            1358
          ],
          "block_id": 6,
          "block_order": 6
        },
        {
          "block_label": "paragraph_title",
          "block_content": "(2)主要城市：",
          "block_bbox": [
            326,
            1400,
            606,
            1451
          ],
          "block_id": 7,
          "block_order": 7
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "圣保罗：经济中心，最大的城市和工业中心",
          "block_bbox": [
            386,
            1488,
            1269,
            1546
          ],
          "block_id": 8,
          "block_order": 8
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "里约热内卢：商业和金融中心，第二大城市.",
          "block_bbox": [
            390,
            1584,
            1271,
            1644
          ],
          "block_id": 9,
          "block_order": 9
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "巴西利亚：政治中心，首都、是新建城市.",
          "block_bbox": [
            391,
            1680,
            1259,
            1735
          ],
          "block_id": 10,
          "block_order": 10
        },
        {
          "block_label": "number",
          "block_content": "47",
          "block_bbox": [
